{'symbol': 'CARR', 'date': '2023-06-09 19:06:00', 'title': 'CARRIER HEALTHY BUILDINGS AND HOMES SOLUTIONS HELP PROTECT INDOOR AIR QUALITY FROM WILDFIRE SMOKE', 'text': 'PALM BEACH GARDENS, FLA. , JUNE 9, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AS PART OF ITS COMMITMENT TO HEALTHY BUILDINGS AND HEALTHY HOMES, CARRIER GLOBAL CORPORATION (NYSE:CARR), GLOBAL LEADER IN INTELLIGENT CLIMATE AND ENERGY SOLUTIONS,\xa0OFFERS A SUITE OF SOLUTIONS TO HELP KEEP PEOPLE SAFE FROM POOR OUTDOOR AIR QUALITY IN THE WAKE OF THE CANADIAN WILDFIRES.'}